@[simp] theorem linFam_op (c α γ x y : R) :
    (linFam c α γ).op x y = α * x + (1 + c * γ - α) * y := rfl

/-- Which coefficient pairs can satisfy equation `313`, `x ◇ x = y ◇ (x ◇ y)`.

The two coefficient equations eliminate to `s * (s - 1) = 0` for the sum
`s = α + β`, with integral cofactors; on the slice `s = 1` the system collapses to
`α ^ 2 - α + 1 = 0`. -/
